# Line-ending policy. Everything checks out as LF on every platform, so a
# Windows clone cannot rewrite text files to CRLF. This repository depends on
# exact bytes more than most: the determinism gate compares two `.cctrace`
# runs with `cmp`, trace hashes are shown as proof in the theater, and the
# pinned fixtures and exhibit manifests are compared verbatim. A CRLF rewrite
# breaks those comparisons for a reason that is slow to diagnose.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never convert
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
tests/golden/*.bin binary
